pi.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/deployments","created_at":"2011-08-14T21:33:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T20:11:57Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-05T03:28:29Z","git_url":"git://github.com/tj/commander.js.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:tj/commander.js.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js","homepage":"","size":4034,"stargazers_count":28416,"watchers_count":28416,"language":"JavaScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1783,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":12,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":1783,"open_issues":12,"watchers":28416,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/2615","html_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2615","diff_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2615.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2615.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-28T04:11:09Z"},"body":"## Problem\r\n\r\nOption variadic detection used `\\w`, which only recognises ASCII word characters.\r\n\r\nAs a result, Unicode placeholders such as `--tag <值...>` were treated as non-variadic options, causing parsing of multiple values to fail with an excess-argument error.\r\n\r\nThe same issue also affects placeholders whose final identifier character is a Unicode combining mark or connector punctuation, such as decomposed names and the exact reproduction discussed in #2614.\r\n\r\nFixes #2614.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nUse the Unicode `ID_Continue` property to recognise valid identifier-continuation characters immediately before the variadic ellipsis.\r\n\r\nThis covers:\r\n\r\n- Unicode letters and numbers\r\n- Combining marks\r\n- Connector punctuation\r\n- Existing ASCII word characters\r\n\r\nThis preserves the existing behaviour for ASCII placeholders while continuing to reject non-variadic or malformed forms such as `<value,...>`, `<...>`, and `<value....>`.\r\n\r\n## Tests\r\n\r\nAdded one regression test alongside the existing variadic special-case tests: a placeholder ending in a decomposed Unicode combining mark (`[cafe\\u0301...]`) is recognised as variadic.\r\n\r\nThe existing `[value,...]` test continues to verify that CSV-like single-argument placeholders are not treated as variadic. I also manually verified that the issue's `<值...>` example collects both values. On Node 22.19.0, the full suite passed (1,405 passed, 4 skipped), along with type, lint, and format checks.\r\n\r\n## ChangeLog\r\n\r\n- Support Unicode variadic option placeholders, including combining marks and connector punctuation.\r\n\r\nSome code and tests were assisted by Codex. I reviewed, understood, and tested the complete change and take responsibility for it.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/2615/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/2615/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/comments/5745346381","html_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/issues/2614#issuecomment-5745346381","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/2614","id":5745346381,"node_id":"IC_kwDOACGs6c8AAAABVnMHTQ","user":{"login":"shadowspawn","id":15719847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzE5ODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15719847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn","html_url":"https://github.com/shadowspawn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-19T21:14:18Z","updated_at":"2026-09-19T21:24:04Z","body":"Do you use Commander, and unicode option names are something you use in your CLI? (Or is this a theoretical problem noticed from code inspection?)\n\nEdit: this is affecting the placeholder, not the option name. The placeholder is more likely to include unicode characters than the option name.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/comments/5745346381/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"},"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"shadowspawn","id":15719847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzE5ODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15719847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn","html_url":"https://github.com/shadowspawn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowspawn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/comments/5745478865","html_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/issues/2614#issuecomment-5745478865","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/2614","id":5745478865,"node_id":"IC_kwDOACGs6c8AAAABVnUM0Q","user":{"login":"shadowspawn","id":15719847,"node_id":"M